        <mxCell id="p405" value="&lt;b&gt;#405 · resume monitor (el mas complejo)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. SessionEnd supersedes waiter (no mas 24h de falso-live)&lt;br&gt;2. lease cloud con receiverOwner — teardown no roba lease del monitor&lt;br&gt;3. waiter dormante pauseWhile — arma en cada Stop, toma control al expirar lease&lt;br&gt;4. release atomico compare-and-delete (rename+hardlink) — fin del TOCTOU&lt;br&gt;5. OpenClaw migrado a owner tokens + options shape&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;f62ea5c+848baa7 · respuesta 7173309495 · CI en curso&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="250" width="560" height="160" as="geometry" />
